          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "буксировать (buksírovat) is built on буксир 'a tug, a towrope'. Буксир is usually traced to a Dutch sailors' word for towing; EtymDB lists it without a source, so the line is hedged."
